flowchart LR
    subgraph core[Core Domain]
        video((Video Content Context))
        discovery((Discovery Context))
        interaction((Interaction Context))
    end

    

    subgraph supporting[Supporting Domains]
        account((Account Context))
        moderation((Moderation Context))
    end

    subgraph generic[Generic Domains]
        notification((Notification Context))
    end

    subgraph infrastructure[Infrastructure Domain]
        media((Video Storage Service))
        identity((External Identity Provider))
    end

    account -->|Customer Supplier: identity data| video
    account -->|Customer Supplier: user profile| interaction
    video -->|Published Language: video metadata| discovery
    interaction -->|Published Language: engagement events| discovery
    video -->|Open Host Service: moderation request| moderation
    moderation -->|Customer Supplier: moderation decision| video
    interaction -->|Open Host Service: notification request| notification
    video -->|Open Host Service: media storage| media
    account -->|Anti-Corruption Layer| identity

